    "marks": "Each claim tuple stays one text node (the PWB-REQ-020 sweep's leaf rule); after it, one empty <span> per present field takes the declared class of the tuple's own attribute value (local resolution) and renders the declared symbol, with empty alternative text, in the declared token. Missing freshness emits no freshness mark; the existing currency disclosure follows the marks.",
